<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-19T04:59:02.653Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:59:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard and Japan Coast Guard conducted an anti-piracy drill in Manila Bay while the United States and the Philippines held their 16th bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea. Chinese coast guard ships entered restricted waters near the Pratas Islands and Chinese navy vessels operated near Scarborough Shoal, prompting a Philippine lawmaker to call for a review of water-cannon use against Chinese vessels and an envoy to warn China could easily win a conflict with the Philippines. The PCG rescued four people, including a child, on Hagonoy Island in Surigao del Sur. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE9QT0c4aFJTMjEzVEM3TDhqaGZ0U1JTNUVzTVltbWdwNkpQSXl1RG91QjNpTWZRTHhkdjJRcFAyN0hyTVE4cTQ0VmRPeVVtRWZwcjFraA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taiwan News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQazFqbGRqLWxMWE1wRmpiTjdYX0JpSHUtQjA3XzZvT29naFFXVEU2MTZxWFFRalJROE1PZjJxSGtKX0RxX0pnTnJJaXY4S1dTLVU4R3pqeXRqQUNXWmFvdlhHNE5aaDRDRW52Um5mdGEzQl90Vy1fZGFIX2liS081WVN6X0ZtYTV4eGtuUDdBOEVLN1VNTllNRWRUMzZfRmZqYVRfc2tDZE8tejUwOEQwTXZHQk0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE5OUU1WZmxLcHl3TnRxZFJCSGJtaEtqV28tbFNSR1laSUpUTDB2dXdvcTF1N2lSU1Vuc1NtZ3JZandyMmJBUGpDWmxiaEFlVUxFclg4NzBMQmM5aUZ5VXI4cmFGeG5lOGZXYTg4M3A5V0lRTmlkTFVmMlNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taipei Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiO0FVX3lxTE8xdTROalVOQXRWVmVKRVlwWTM1X2hGU1NKcVNJNW9WaW5tZHpNVWJMTWZyak41ajF1RDVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Howl.link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo